OL,3,GNEWSATV stars and authors to descend on
OL,4,Acity for lit fest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV stars and BAFTA-winning authors are
OL,7,Fset to appear at a volunteer-run
OL,8,Fliterary festival.
OL,10,FBristol's Clifton LitFest, running from
OL,11,FFriday to Sunday, was started by the
OL,12,FFriends of the Clifton Library and has
OL,13,Fdoubled in size since launching in
OL,14,F2019.
OL,16,FTaking place in shops and churches
OL,17,Facross Clifton, TV stars Mary Portas
OL,18,Fand Jonathan Porritt will appear
OL,19,Falongside John Davidson, whose memoir
OL,20,Fwas turned into the BAFTA-winning film
OL,21,FI Swear.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
