OL,3,GNEWSATV stars and authors to descend on
OL,4,Acity for lit fest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV presenter Jonathan Dimbleby, author
OL,7,Fand patron of Clifton Lit Fest, said he
OL,8,Fparticularly likes that the event
OL,9,F"belongs to the community". He added
OL,10,Fthat its profits go to Bristol's
OL,11,Flibraries, giving the festival a
OL,12,F"social purpose".
